Interoperability sources:

  - The protocol facts tagged [CODE] in PROTOCOL-SPEC.md were read from Bitwig's MIT-licensed controller
    extensions (the APC64 extension) and from Akai's APC64 Project Editor for Windows. No Bitwig or Akai source
    or program files are redistributed in this repository.
  - The harmony core's note spelling and chord detection follow the author's own MusicCat Explorer.

Test fixtures (fixtures/):

  - Captures of a real APC64's own MIDI and SysEx output (identity replies, surface presses, mode reports,
    project and global-settings dumps), recorded for testing. The unit's serial number is replaced by a
    placeholder (ASCII "000000000000000") in every capture.
  - "Boss RC-600.APC64", a preset file the author made and saved with Akai's APC64 Project Editor, used only as a test vector for the
    .APC64 file format (PROTOCOL-SPEC.md §8.4).
